[{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1169:b003:l005","ordinal":165377,"en":"\"In your uncle's old age,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1169:b003:l006","ordinal":165378,"en":"May God grant his wish;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1169:b003:l007","ordinal":165379,"en":"May He put the Kalmyk beneath,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1169:b003:l008","ordinal":165380,"en":"And your uncle above,\" they said."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1169:b003:l009","ordinal":165381,"en":"The Muslim people cried out."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1169:b003:l010","ordinal":165382,"en":"At that very moment,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1169:b003:l011","ordinal":165383,"en":"Khan Koshoy of Katagan"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1169:b003:l012","ordinal":165384,"en":"Tugged at the broad belt"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1169:b003:l013","ordinal":165385,"en":"Of Joloy, khan of the Kalmyks."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1169:b003:l014","ordinal":165386,"en":"Where your uncle made the throw,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1169:b003:l015","ordinal":165387,"en":"He drove his chest"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1169:b003:l016","ordinal":165388,"en":"Into Kalmyk Khan Joloy."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1169:b003:l017","ordinal":165389,"en":"Unable to stop the throw,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1169:b003:l018","ordinal":165390,"en":"Joloy stumbled away;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1169:b003:l019","ordinal":165391,"en":"On the yellow hard ground"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1169:b003:l020","ordinal":165392,"en":"His feet could find no hold."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1169:b003:l021","ordinal":165393,"en":"The infidel's bare foot"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1169:b003:l022","ordinal":165394,"en":"Wedged into a hollow."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1169:b003:l023","ordinal":165395,"en":"Upon that huge brute,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1169:b003:l024","ordinal":165396,"en":"Your uncle Koshoy then"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1169:b003:l025","ordinal":165397,"en":"Fell pressing down."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1169:b003:l026","ordinal":165398,"en":"\"Koshoy has thrown Joloy!\" they cried,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1169:b003:l027","ordinal":165399,"en":"The forty companions of Khan Manas."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1169:b003:l028","ordinal":165400,"en":"All flew like arrows"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1169:b003:l029","ordinal":165401,"en":"And converged upon them."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1169:b003:l030","ordinal":165402,"en":"Among the forty companions"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1169:b003:l031","ordinal":165403,"en":"Was the champion named Agayar;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1169:b003:l032","ordinal":165404,"en":"When he grew angry,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1169:b003:l033","ordinal":165405,"en":"He began a great tumult,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1169:b003:l034","ordinal":165406,"en":"And when truly enraged,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1169:b003:l035","ordinal":165407,"en":"He could strike down a camel."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1169:b003:l036","ordinal":165408,"en":"Before one could turn about,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1169:b003:l037","ordinal":165409,"en":"In the blink of an eye,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1169:b003:l038","ordinal":165410,"en":"Where infidel and Muslim"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1169:b005:l001","ordinal":165411,"en":"Were seething together,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1169:b005:l002","ordinal":165412,"en":"Champion Agayar arrived."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1169:b005:l003","ordinal":165413,"en":"He shouldered your uncle Koshoy"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1169:b005:l004","ordinal":165414,"en":"And ran away with him."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1169:b005:l005","ordinal":165415,"en":"The strongest jacket-clad Chinese"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1169:b005:l006","ordinal":165416,"en":"Roared,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1169:b005:l007","ordinal":165417,"en":"And the finest stone-bedecked Kalmyks"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1169:b005:l008","ordinal":165418,"en":"Thundered."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1169:b005:l009","ordinal":165419,"en":"Among the Kalmyks was Ylama,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1169:b005:l010","ordinal":165420,"en":"An interpreter for the Kalmyks—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1169:b005:l011","ordinal":165421,"en":"Do not ask what that interpreter said:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1169:b005:l012","ordinal":165422,"en":"\"The accursed Buruts'"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1169:b005:l013","ordinal":165423,"en":"Best man invited us to the feast;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1169:b005:l014","ordinal":165424,"en":"What is this he has done?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1169:b005:l015","ordinal":165425,"en":"He has apparently been left"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1169:b005:l016","ordinal":165426,"en":"To put on bulletproof armor;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1169:b005:l017","ordinal":165427,"en":"This accursed Burut"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1169:b005:l018","ordinal":165428,"en":"Has apparently been left to attack us."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1169:b005:l019","ordinal":165429,"en":"There is pressing down, they say,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1169:b005:l020","ordinal":165430,"en":"But no stepping over the head."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1169:b005:l021","ordinal":165431,"en":"There is lifting and throwing, they say,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1169:b005:l022","ordinal":165432,"en":"But no kicking in the chest."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1169:b005:l023","ordinal":165433,"en":"There was permission to throw a man,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1169:b005:l024","ordinal":165434,"en":"But none to kick him in the groin."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1169:b005:l025","ordinal":165435,"en":"At the place where belts are girded,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1169:b005:l026","ordinal":165436,"en":"At the place where contests are held,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1169:b005:l027","ordinal":165437,"en":"This accursed Burut—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1169:b005:l028","ordinal":165438,"en":"What has he done?\""},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1169:b005:l029","ordinal":165439,"en":"Bridling as though to attack,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1169:b005:l030","ordinal":165440,"en":"The Black Chinese and Manchu host"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1169:b005:l031","ordinal":165441,"en":"All surged forward together;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1169:b005:l032","ordinal":165442,"en":"The finest stone-bedecked Chinese"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1169:b005:l033","ordinal":165443,"en":"Were carried away with rage."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1169:b005:l034","ordinal":165444,"en":"Those deftest with spears,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1169:b005:l035","ordinal":165445,"en":"Those strongest with battle-axes,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1169:b005:l036","ordinal":165446,"en":"Advanced with a rumble,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1169:b005:l037","ordinal":165447,"en":"As though to engulf the Kyrgyz"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1169:b005:l038","ordinal":165448,"en":"And leave slaughter behind."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1170:b003:l001","ordinal":165449,"en":"Now God struck the Chinese;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1170:b003:l002","ordinal":165450,"en":"The Manchus, rumbling,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1170:b003:l003","ordinal":165451,"en":"Spoke harsh words."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1170:b003:l004","ordinal":165452,"en":"They beat hard"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1170:b003:l005","ordinal":165453,"en":"The war drum used for battle."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1170:b003:l006","ordinal":165454,"en":"The war drum sounded loudly;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1170:b003:l007","ordinal":165455,"en":"Black Kalmyks, many Manchus,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1170:b003:l008","ordinal":165456,"en":"And the seething multitude of lords"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1170:b003:l009","ordinal":165457,"en":"Closed ranks as if to engulf them."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1170:b003:l010","ordinal":165458,"en":"They armed themselves in confusion,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1170:b003:l011","ordinal":165459,"en":"Strapping on battle-axes, armor, and swords"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1170:b003:l012","ordinal":165460,"en":"Every which way."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1170:b003:l013","ordinal":165461,"en":"The Manchu people roared;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1170:b003:l014","ordinal":165462,"en":"Squad leaders strutted,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1170:b003:l015","ordinal":165463,"en":"Leaders of fifty sprang about,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1170:b003:l016","ordinal":165464,"en":"Leaders of hundreds ran,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1170:b003:l017","ordinal":165465,"en":"And commanders of thousands despaired of life."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1170:b003:l018","ordinal":165466,"en":"When the Chinese showed their fury,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1170:b003:l019","ordinal":165467,"en":"They took it as an insult,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1170:b003:l020","ordinal":165468,"en":"Saying, \"He steps over the khan's head.\""},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1170:b003:l021","ordinal":165469,"en":"The Muslims who came to the feast"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1170:b003:l022","ordinal":165470,"en":"Were pressed into dreadful straits."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1170:b003:l023","ordinal":165471,"en":"Their khojas in white turbans,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1170:b003:l024","ordinal":165472,"en":"Their mullahs who recited lessons,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1170:b003:l025","ordinal":165473,"en":"Wrapped their belts as turbans,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1170:b003:l026","ordinal":165474,"en":"Implored the Almighty,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1170:b003:l027","ordinal":165475,"en":"Lost their wits,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1170:b003:l028","ordinal":165476,"en":"And fled then,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1170:b003:l029","ordinal":165477,"en":"Crowding toward Manas."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1170:b003:l030","ordinal":165478,"en":"Then leopard Manas"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1170:b003:l031","ordinal":165479,"en":"Stepped apart with courage,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1170:b003:l032","ordinal":165480,"en":"Showing the form of a lion."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1170:b003:l033","ordinal":165481,"en":"Almambet and Chubak together"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1170:b003:l034","ordinal":165482,"en":"Led his prancing bay horse,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1170:b003:l035","ordinal":165483,"en":"With twelve companions."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1170:b003:l036","ordinal":165484,"en":"Manas stepped away from the companions,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1170:b003:l037","ordinal":165485,"en":"Showing the form of a dragon,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1170:b003:l038","ordinal":165486,"en":"Straining and heaving in fury."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1170:b004:l001","ordinal":165487,"en":"Your uncle, leopard Bakay,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1170:b004:l002","ordinal":165488,"en":"Seized Manas as he struggled:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1170:b004:l003","ordinal":165489,"en":"\"We invited you to the feast as people,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1170:b004:l004","ordinal":165490,"en":"But you Black Kalmyks and Chinese"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1170:b004:l005","ordinal":165491,"en":"Have become depraved;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1170:b004:l006","ordinal":165492,"en":"My roaring Chinese,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1170:b004:l007","ordinal":165493,"en":"You have become impossible."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1170:b004:l008","ordinal":165494,"en":"If you mean to fight to the death, say so plainly."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1170:b004:l009","ordinal":165495,"en":"If I do not mount Akkula"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1170:b004:l010","ordinal":165496,"en":"And drive your lord shouting"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1170:b004:l011","ordinal":165497,"en":"Toward Beijing—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1170:b004:l012","ordinal":165498,"en":"If you are guests, state your purpose;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1170:b004:l013","ordinal":165499,"en":"If you would domineer, say so plainly."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1170:b004:l014","ordinal":165500,"en":"I invited you as people to the feast;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1170:b004:l015","ordinal":165501,"en":"Put aside your pride and eat your meat."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1170:b004:l016","ordinal":165502,"en":"If you want slaughter, give your answer;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1170:b004:l017","ordinal":165503,"en":"Let us make the carnage a spectacle."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1170:b004:l018","ordinal":165504,"en":"Accursed Chinese, give your answer!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1170:b004:l019","ordinal":165505,"en":"I am not Manas who will bow,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1170:b004:l020","ordinal":165506,"en":"And you are not Chinese who can overpower me.\""},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1170:b004:l021","ordinal":165507,"en":"Glaring fiercely,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1170:b004:l022","ordinal":165508,"en":"Venom spilling from his mouth,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1170:b004:l023","ordinal":165509,"en":"Looming like Ala-Too,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1170:b004:l024","ordinal":165510,"en":"He strained in fury."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1170:b004:l025","ordinal":165511,"en":"\"Let me go!\" he cried to Bakay,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1170:b004:l026","ordinal":165512,"en":"And Manas struggled with a deep roar."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1170:b004:l027","ordinal":165513,"en":"The forty companions split in two,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1170:b004:l028","ordinal":165514,"en":"As though about to begin slaughter,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1170:b004:l029","ordinal":165515,"en":"Looming like Ala-Too."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1170:b004:l030","ordinal":165516,"en":"Wearing a coat of yellow gold,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1170:b004:l031","ordinal":165517,"en":"Mounted on a piebald horse,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1170:b004:l032","ordinal":165518,"en":"Wrath showing on his face,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1170:b004:l033","ordinal":165519,"en":"A sheathless sword at his side,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1170:b004:l034","ordinal":165520,"en":"He looked ready to slaughter them."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1170:b004:l035","ordinal":165521,"en":"Wearing a blue rapys coat,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1170:b004:l036","ordinal":165522,"en":"Mounted on a mottled blue horse—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1170:b004:l037","ordinal":165523,"en":"Such was Chubak's way."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1170:b004:l038","ordinal":165524,"en":"The lion born to Akbaltay,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1171:b003:l001","ordinal":165525,"en":"The deftest spearman,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1171:b003:l002","ordinal":165526,"en":"Akbaltay's Chubak,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1171:b003:l003","ordinal":165527,"en":"Finest of the pale-yellow warriors."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1171:b003:l004","ordinal":165528,"en":"The Chinese lost heart;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1171:b003:l005","ordinal":165529,"en":"Your precious Chubak appeared,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1171:b003:l006","ordinal":165530,"en":"And with a hungry shout and fierce battle cry,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1171:b004:l001","ordinal":165531,"en":"He charged in shouting."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1171:b004:l002","ordinal":165532,"en":"\"We were guests, hero,\" they said."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1171:b004:l003","ordinal":165533,"en":"The finest stone-bedecked Chinese"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1171:b004:l004","ordinal":165534,"en":"Gathered together,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1171:b004:l005","ordinal":165535,"en":"And the Black Kalmyks and Manchus"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1171:b004:l006","ordinal":165536,"en":"Subsided and sat down heavily."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1171:b006:l001","ordinal":165537,"en":"Along the Uch-Karkyra"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1171:b006:l002","ordinal":165538,"en":"A gathering now formed in a ring."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1171:b006:l003","ordinal":165539,"en":"From the city of Kakanchyn,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1171:b006:l004","ordinal":165540,"en":"Thinking, \"If there is conflict with the Buruts,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1171:b006:l005","ordinal":165541,"en":"He may prove useful,\""},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1171:b006:l006","ordinal":165542,"en":"They had brought a champion"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1171:b006:l007","ordinal":165543,"en":"With strength unknown to man."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1171:b006:l008","ordinal":165544,"en":"The champion of the infidels"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1171:b006:l009","ordinal":165545,"en":"Was hairy-soled Tukubay;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1171:b006:l010","ordinal":165546,"en":"That indeed was his name."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1171:b006:l011","ordinal":165547,"en":"For slaughter in particular,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1171:b006:l012","ordinal":165548,"en":"They had prepared this formidable man."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1171:b006:l013","ordinal":165549,"en":"He never spared one who grappled with him,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1171:b006:l014","ordinal":165550,"en":"And a whole pig's meat"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1171:b006:l015","ordinal":165551,"en":"Did not fill him at one sitting."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1171:b006:l016","ordinal":165552,"en":"When he charged in fury,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1171:b006:l017","ordinal":165553,"en":"It was the end of days for a man;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1171:b006:l018","ordinal":165554,"en":"He was a merciless champion."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1171:b006:l019","ordinal":165555,"en":"The breadth of his nape"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1171:b006:l020","ordinal":165556,"en":"Was twelve spans."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1171:b006:l021","ordinal":165557,"en":"Tukubay entered the wrestling ground"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1171:b006:l022","ordinal":165558,"en":"And stood staring with a grunt."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1171:b006:l023","ordinal":165559,"en":"Kokotoy's Bokmurun"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1171:b006:l024","ordinal":165560,"en":"Issued another proclamation:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1171:b006:l025","ordinal":165561,"en":"\"My father Kokotoy has not died;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1171:b006:l026","ordinal":165562,"en":"Kokotoy's wealth"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1171:b006:l027","ordinal":165563,"en":"Has grown like spring grass."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1171:b006:l028","ordinal":165564,"en":"Today I open the treasury"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1171:b006:l029","ordinal":165565,"en":"That fills forty rooms."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1171:b009:l001","ordinal":165566,"en":"For infidel and Muslim,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1171:b009:l002","ordinal":165567,"en":"I will scatter it lavishly."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1171:b009:l003","ordinal":165568,"en":"With lower lips drooping,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1171:b009:l004","ordinal":165569,"en":"With tusks jutting,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1171:b009:l005","ordinal":165570,"en":"Necks raised like ducks,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1171:b009:l006","ordinal":165571,"en":"Their two humps towering,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1171:b009:l007","ordinal":165572,"en":"I will slaughter one thousand camels."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1171:b009:l008","ordinal":165573,"en":"With branching horns jutting,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1171:b009:l009","ordinal":165574,"en":"I will slaughter one thousand cattle."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1171:b009:l010","ordinal":165575,"en":"Making their foals cry out,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1171:b009:l011","ordinal":165576,"en":"To begin this spectacle,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1171:b009:l012","ordinal":165577,"en":"I will slaughter one thousand mares."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1171:b009:l013","ordinal":165578,"en":"Making their lambs bleat,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1171:b009:l014","ordinal":165579,"en":"Lining up their mothers,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1171:b009:l015","ordinal":165580,"en":"Delighting those who slaughter them,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1171:b009:l016","ordinal":165581,"en":"I will kill one thousand sheep."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1171:b009:l017","ordinal":165582,"en":"Dividing gold like stones,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1171:b009:l018","ordinal":165583,"en":"Showing my wealth to the people,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1171:b009:l019","ordinal":165584,"en":"I will stake this much gold."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1171:b009:l020","ordinal":165585,"en":"Infidel and Muslim,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1171:b009:l021","ordinal":165586,"en":"Let the people assemble;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1171:b009:l022","ordinal":165587,"en":"Hold another wrestling match."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1171:b009:l023","ordinal":165588,"en":"Strive without regret,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1171:b009:l024","ordinal":165589,"en":"Grip firmly and grapple,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1171:b009:l025","ordinal":165590,"en":"And win your prize outright."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1171:b009:l026","ordinal":165591,"en":"My wealth is inexhaustible;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1171:b009:l027","ordinal":165592,"en":"Make a proper spectacle,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1171:b009:l028","ordinal":165593,"en":"And divide Kokotoy's abundant riches"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1171:b009:l029","ordinal":165594,"en":"Without quarreling.\""},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1172:b003:l001","ordinal":165595,"en":"Kokotoy's Bokmurun"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1172:b003:l002","ordinal":165596,"en":"Issued another proclamation."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1172:b003:l003","ordinal":165597,"en":"The Chinese Tukubay,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1172:b003:l004","ordinal":165598,"en":"The hairy-soled champion,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1172:b003:l005","ordinal":165599,"en":"Stepped out to wrestle."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1172:b003:l006","ordinal":165600,"en":"\"No one who grapples"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1172:b003:l007","ordinal":165601,"en":"With a wrathful infidel prospers;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1172:b003:l008","ordinal":165602,"en":"No one who challenges him survives,\" they said."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1172:b003:l009","ordinal":165603,"en":"Holy Khan Manas"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1172:b003:l010","ordinal":165604,"en":"Was troubled."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1172:b003:l011","ordinal":165605,"en":"Before much time had passed—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1172:b003:l012","ordinal":165606,"en":"God spare us such a sight—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1172:b003:l013","ordinal":165607,"en":"The saintly Khan Bakay,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1172:b003:l014","ordinal":165608,"en":"Agybay of Argyn Khan,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1172:b003:l015","ordinal":165609,"en":"Chubak of Akbaltay,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1172:b003:l016","ordinal":165610,"en":"Almambet of Azoozil,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1172:b003:l017","ordinal":165611,"en":"Jamgyrchy of the Esheks,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1172:b003:l018","ordinal":165612,"en":"Hero Toshtuk, son of Eleman,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1172:b003:l019","ordinal":165613,"en":"Urbush of the Kipchaks,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1172:b003:l020","ordinal":165614,"en":"With an armful of weapons at his belt,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1172:b003:l021","ordinal":165615,"en":"Muzburchak, son of Buudayyk,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1172:b003:l022","ordinal":165616,"en":"Kokcho of the Kazakhs,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1172:b003:l023","ordinal":165617,"en":"Synjybek of Andijan,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1172:b003:l024","ordinal":165618,"en":"Akun Khan from Afghanistan,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1172:b003:l025","ordinal":165619,"en":"And the two giants Janaaly and Karach,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1172:b003:l026","ordinal":165620,"en":"Who dwelt in Chambyl-Bel"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1172:b003:l027","ordinal":165621,"en":"And were called peerlessly mighty heroes—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1172:b003:l028","ordinal":165622,"en":"The Muslim people were there,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1172:b003:l029","ordinal":165623,"en":"And heroes who boasted of courage"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1172:b003:l030","ordinal":165624,"en":"Had all arrived together."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1172:b003:l031","ordinal":165625,"en":"All the khans assembled;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1172:b003:l032","ordinal":165626,"en":"Destroyer Khan Manas was there,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1172:b003:l033","ordinal":165627,"en":"And all the saints were there."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1172:b003:l034","ordinal":165628,"en":"The infidel champion who came out"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1172:b003:l035","ordinal":165629,"en":"Could seemingly tear apart"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1172:b003:l036","ordinal":165630,"en":"Any man he grappled with."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1172:b003:l037","ordinal":165631,"en":"His bulk was half a mountain;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1172:b003:l038","ordinal":165632,"en":"He looked able to devour his opponent."}]
